==Battleground==
*4 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*6 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Yuma Kuga & Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**5 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**2 [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is primarily filled with Red enemies, so bring units like [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] and any other [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]] units you may have to deal with the One Horns and Seals, who are the primary threats in this stage.

